<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20274] "lctl llog remove" invoking jt_llog_check instead of jt_llog_remove</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20274</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When lctl llog_* commands were refactored into subcommands in &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18114" title="lctl and lfs command &amp;quot;groups&amp;quot; should be split into subcommands" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18114"&gt;LU-18114&lt;/a&gt; (commit fe4b49635d), the new llog_cmdlist[] table in lustre/utils/lctl.c was assembled.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The "remove" entry had its .pc_func left as jt_llog_check instead of being updated to jt_llog_remove:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-comment"&gt;/* lctl.c: llog_cmdlist[] */&lt;/span&gt;
  { .pc_name = &lt;span class="code-quote"&gt;"check"&lt;/span&gt;,  .pc_func = jt_llog_check,  ... },
  { .pc_name = &lt;span class="code-quote"&gt;"remove"&lt;/span&gt;, .pc_func = jt_llog_check,  ... },  &lt;span class="code-comment"&gt;/* should be jt_llog_remove */&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discovered by code inspect.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
